        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I addressed the issues and comments so I have marked this as \"ready to review\" again.\r\n\r\nI also ran alot of LLM code reviews which found some race conditions and edge cases. I fixed them, but this balloon the size of this PR quite a bit.\r\nIt would be great if someone can offer me some guidance on whether all of the fixes are really needed or whether some should be sacrificed for the sake of keeping the code simpler.",
